# `version` and `date-released` name the latest published release, 0.6.2: the Amendment 6
# manuscript, whose title and abstract are the ones above. Published 2026-11-25 on Zenodo and
# Figshare on the principal's go (perturb-seq-eval approvals row 43).
version: "0.6.2"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: "Apache-2.0"
# Concept DOI — always resolves to the latest Zenodo version. Lineage:
# v1 (19716141): anonymous-authors placeholder (superseded);
# v2 (19721470): v0.4.1 with correct authorship (superseded);
# v3 (19748260): v0.5.0 real-data headline rewrite (superseded by v0.5.1
#                because the abstract/intro/limits/repro sections still
#                carried legacy synthetic-DGP claims);
# v4 (20060974): v0.5.1 — every synthetic-data claim retracted from the
#                paper body; CI guardrail forbids synthetic-cell generators.
# v5 (20074427): v0.5.2, 2026-05-07. Its record's notes are empty and its description repeats
#                the v0.5.0 abstract. By md5 comparison of the file lists, only paper.pdf differs
#                from v0.5.1, and that paper.pdf is identical to Figshare 32086920 v5's; what
#                changed inside the PDF is not recorded anywhere. v0.6.0 is the NEXT VERSION
#                under this concept DOI (new version from v5, 10.5281/zenodo.20074427) and the
#                next version of Figshare 32086920 (principal D-1 = B, 2026-10-16).
# v6 (23422745): v0.6.0, published 2026-10-16 — the pre-registered study; supersedes v0.5.x in full.
#                Same release published as Figshare 32086920 version 6.
#                CROSS-LINKED 2026-10-25: a metadata-only edit added
#                `isIdenticalTo 10.6084/m9.figshare.32086920.v6` to this Zenodo record, so the two
#                deposits now reference each other — Figshare v6 already carried the Zenodo concept
#                DOI. Figshare was deliberately left untouched: republishing it would mint a v7 for a
#                link that already exists. Applied and read back by the perturb-seq-eval agent
#                (dispatch #734); DOI, version and the 5 file checksums unchanged, and no new Zenodo
#                version was created. Not independently verified by the CTO, which holds no venue
#                tokens.
# v7 (24430429): 0.6.1, published 2026-11-22 — a manuscript revision of v0.6.0 (Amendment 5 retitle and
#                narrowed contribution, tag v0.6.0-a5, plus one related-work sentence on Morandi 2026).
#                The v0.6.0 run and every outcome are unchanged. Same release published as Figshare
#                32086920 version 7; paper.pdf md5-identical on both, read back from the public APIs.
#                The Zenodo record does NOT yet carry `isIdenticalTo` the Figshare v7 DOI.
# v8 (24518637): 0.6.2, published 2026-11-25 — the Amendment 6 manuscript revision of 0.6.1 (tag
#                v0.6.0-a6): the error-feedback disclosure, the reframed reading of the H4 pass, a
#                labelled exploratory section with two figures, and the new title. The v0.6.0 run and
#                every outcome are unchanged. Built from commit 07a5e57b. Same release published as
#                Figshare 32086920 version 8; paper.pdf md5-identical on both, downloaded from the
#                public records. The Zenodo record does NOT yet carry `isIdenticalTo` the Figshare v8
#                DOI.
